      "prompt": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "A group of 10 gardeners recorded data on the germination rates of their tomato crop for one\ngrowing season. The scatterplot shows the relationship between the number of tomato seeds\nplanted, $x$, and the number of tomato seeds that germinated, $y$ , for each of the gardeners. A line\nof best fit is also shown."
